// Must keep RUNNING. This is census cell `c002045`, kept verbatim.
//
// When D207's bound was measured (2026-08-27) the ungated lift moved 620 block-C cells from
// a loud reject to check-clean INVALID WASM, and every one of them sat at this coordinate: a
